OL,3,AMultiple flights in Europe hit by
OL,4,A'malicious hoax threats', UK transport
OL,5,Asecretary says
OL,6,
OL,7,FFlights across Europe have been
OL,8,Fimpacted by bomb threats for the second
OL,9,Ftime this week
OL,11,FAt least 18 flights have reportedly
OL,12,Fbeen impacted - see a recap here
OL,14,FUK Transport Secretary Heidi Alexander
OL,15,Fdescribes them as "malicious hoax
OL,16,Fthreats" - a government spokesperson
OL,17,Fsays threats to UK flights have been
OL,18,F"resolved"
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
