OL,3,AMultiple flights in Europe hit by
OL,4,A'malicious hoax threats', UK transport
OL,5,Asecretary says
OL,6,
OL,7,FAirport authorities in Rome say they
OL,8,Freceived a threat on email from a group
OL,9,Fcalled "Fighters of the Male State"
OL,10,Fclaiming to be targeting a "feminist
OL,11,Fregime"
OL,13,FIn Prague, Czech police say no
OL,14,Fexplosives were found aboard four
OL,15,Fflights, following threats about an
OL,16,F"improvised explosive device"
OL,18,FAn aircraft was escorted into Rome
OL,19,FFiumicino Airport by Italian Air Force
OL,20,Fjets, while the Bulgarian military says
OL,21,Fits jets escorted three aircraft to
OL,22,FSofia
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
