OL,3,AMultiple flights in Europe hit by
OL,4,A'malicious hoax threats', UK transport
OL,5,Asecretary says
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolish airline LOT says two of its
OL,8,Fplanes were impacted but "no hazardous
OL,9,Fitems were found" - an eyewitness
OL,10,Ffilmed the moment they were met by
OL,11,F'police, military and sniffer dogs' as
OL,12,Fthey evacuated the flight
OL,14,FOn Tuesday, at least seven flights were
OL,15,Fhit by similar threats - no explosives
OL,16,Fwere found
